        points: ["Function declarations are hoisted completely; expressions and arrows are not callable before definition.", "Default parameters (ES6): function f(x = 10).", "Missing arguments become undefined; extra arguments are ignored (available via arguments in normal functions).", "Rest parameter must be last: function f(a, ...rest).", "Functions are first-class: they can be stored in variables, passed as arguments and returned.", "Complexity: a loop over n items is O(n); nested loops O(n\xB2)."],
